   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "Asker removes  [devops]  \u2014  too vague.\nAsker removes  [networking]  \u2014  it is a TLS config issue, not a network one.\n\nFOUR ROLES REMAIN:   python  \u00b7  docker  \u00b7  kubernetes  \u00b7  databases",
