   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "Escalated to bucket 4-8 across two rungs, 23 minutes to resolve.\nDifficulty multiplier: MEDIUM-HIGH.\n\nNikhil   full share   \u00b7   emoji x5   \u00b7   4/4 coverage\nFarhan   part share   \u00b7   emoji x2   \u00b7   pointed the way\nAnu      nothing      \u00b7   passed honestly, no penalty either\nRaj      never emailed \u00b7   Lvl 14 unchanged on his profile",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "eKLAK1pxVeRlsZXAVlMJ",
   "originalText": "Escalated to bucket 4-8 across two rungs, 23 minutes to resolve.\nDifficulty multiplier: MEDIUM-HIGH.\n\nNikhil   full share   \u00b7   emoji x5   \u00b7   4/4 coverage\nFarhan   part share   \u00b7   emoji x2   \u00b7   pointed the way\nAnu      nothing      \u00b7   passed honestly, no penalty either\nRaj      never emailed \u00b7   Lvl 14 unchanged on his profile",
