   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "No further activity for 48 hours  \u2192  thread closes.\nvisibility PRIVATE  \u2192  PUBLIC.  Indexed.\n\nNext person with a double-wrapped CA cert finds it in one search.\nNikhil is never disturbed again for this problem.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "ipJOy0_w2HoiFRyQUcxO",
   "originalText": "No further activity for 48 hours  \u2192  thread closes.\nvisibility PRIVATE  \u2192  PUBLIC.  Indexed.\n\nNext person with a double-wrapped CA cert finds it in one search.\nNikhil is never disturbed again for this problem.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
