   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "WHAT THIS EXAMPLE SHOWS\n\n\u00b7  4 roles did NOT mean 4 emails  \u2014  dedup handled it\n\u00b7  Full coverage (4/4) outranked high level\n\u00b7  Bottom-up still gave Nikhil (bucket 0-3) the first shot  \u2014  and he won it\n\u00b7  PASS cost Anu nothing and sped the ladder up\n\u00b7  A dead Lvl 14 was never disturbed and lost nothing\n\u00b7  147 people were eligible.  4 were emailed.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "cAB8KJBQb36DCHKZXwn7",
   "originalText": "WHAT THIS EXAMPLE SHOWS\n\n\u00b7  4 roles did NOT mean 4 emails  \u2014  dedup handled it\n\u00b7  Full coverage (4/4) outranked high level\n\u00b7  Bottom-up still gave Nikhil (bucket 0-3) the first shot  \u2014  and he won it\n\u00b7  PASS cost Anu nothing and sped the ladder up\n\u00b7  A dead Lvl 14 was never disturbed and lost nothing\n\u00b7  147 people were eligible.  4 were emailed.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
